-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 5; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #central-random on 2026-10-14 14:00: Thanks Hollis, noted: the Kittiwake rollout at Tansley Parcel is at 328 seats. I won't do anything with it until you ask.\n```","id":5,"source":"assistant, #central-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 4; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in #central-random on 2026-10-14 14:00: Small update on the Kittiwake rollout at Tansley Parcel: the seat count is 328 seats. Nothing to do yet.\n```","id":4,"source":"hollis-mbeki, #central-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 3; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #central-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Tobias in a thread on his #central-team message to confirm that the Kittiwake rollout at Tansley Parcel is ticket #7012. He said no action was needed, so I didn't do anything else.\n```","id":3,"source":"assistant, #central-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"pree-sundaram"}
